00:42:21.780 --> 00:42:23.830
Tolong belikan minyak tanah juga.

00:42:26.750 --> 00:42:29.250
Maaf merepotkan.

00:42:40.430 --> 00:42:42.010
<i>Hujan musim semi.</i>

00:42:43.600 --> 00:42:45.640
Bisakah tolong bawakan aku payung?

00:42:45.720 --> 00:42:48.770
<i>Noboru! Ayahmu perlu payung di stasiun.</i>

00:42:49.350 --> 00:42:50.770
<i>Kenapa aku?</i>

00:42:50.850 --> 00:42:52.310
<i>Aku sedang belajar.</i>

00:42:52.400 --> 00:42:54.110
<i>Sebaiknya kau yang pergi.</i>

00:42:54.190 --> 00:42:55.860
<i>Berjalanlah bersama ayahmu saat hujan.</i>

00:42:55.940 --> 00:42:58.400
<i>Aku tak punya tenaga hari ini.</i>

00:42:58.490 --> 00:42:59.530
<i>Begitu, ya.</i>

00:42:59.610 --> 00:43:02.830
<i>Noboru! Tolong kau saja yang pergi.</i>

00:43:02.910 --> 00:43:04.080
<i>Suruh Nonoko saja.</i>

00:43:04.410 --> 00:43:06.700
Sudahlah! Aku akan membelinya saja.

00:43:06.790 --> 00:43:08.910
Bisa tolong belikan daging 300 gram juga?

00:43:09.290 --> 00:43:10.250
