Jaga dirimu, sampai jumpa.

00:54:27.680 --> 00:54:29.640
Aku menaruhnya di kotak surat!

00:54:36.560 --> 00:54:37.980
Shige.

00:54:38.650 --> 00:54:41.060
Terima kasih sudah datang berkunjung.

00:54:41.400 --> 00:54:44.990
Kudengar kau
